      'Idempotency is built into the data model. Every chunk gets a content_hash and the store enforces uniqueness on namespace plus content_hash. Re-ingesting the same source becomes a no-op, so scheduled ingestion can run without duplicating near-identical chunks and weakening retrieval quality.',
